The stamp is "abc", while the target is "ababc".
The state is an empty list of text.
The marks is an empty list of text.
The blanks is an empty list of text.
Place "?" into blanks.
The lasttarget is the last position of target.
The laststamp is the last position of stamp.
For every spot from 0 to lasttarget.
The piece is the slice of target from spot to spot plus 1.
Place piece into state.
For every spot from 0 to laststamp.
The piece is the slice of stamp from spot to spot plus 1.
Place piece into marks.

The found is an empty list of whole numbers.
The match is 1, while the unknown is 0, while the blank is 0, while the same is 0.
For every round from 0 to lasttarget.
For every start from 0 to lasttarget minus laststamp.
Set match to 1.
Set unknown to 0.
For every offset from 0 to laststamp.
The spot is start plus offset.
The here is item spot of state.
The wanted is item offset of marks.
Set blank to 0.
Set same to 0.
If here matches "?", set blank to 1.
If here matches wanted, set same to 1.
If blank is 0 and same is 0, set match to 0.
If blank is 0, add 1 to unknown.
If offset is laststamp and match is 1 and unknown is more than 0, set item start of state to item 0 of blanks, set item (start plus 1) of state to item 0 of blanks, set item (start plus 2) of state to item 0 of blanks, Place start into found.

The last is the last position of found.
For every spot from 0 to last.
The back is last minus spot.
Show item back of found.
